    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Netflix</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">Security</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Authentication &amp; SSO Service</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Build the front door every other service depends on: store passwords safely, prove \"who is this?\" on hundreds of thousands of requests a second, let one login open many apps, and still be able to throw a thief out in seconds.</p>\n      "
